  monster: {fileID: 11400000, guid: aaa54cd99a48cb54ebc7877de9918141, type: 2}
  danger: 4
  background: An experimental breeding product. Travels in packs of five. Has only
    one eye and carries neurotoxins.
  events:
  - icon: {fileID: -332543644476275048, guid: 58f8e13c2d7d6994ba71e579a333b14d, type: 3}
    appearance: '[When order collapses.]'
    solutionLines:
    - Feed them. Their whispers are leaking into the signal.
    - Play a Sound. Drown out the voices in the static.
    lockedLines:
    - "\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0. Their \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0 into the signal."
    - "\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0. Drown out the \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0."
  - icon: {fileID: 8526194235634495433, guid: 835396d8021bf744c9ac60b725d2c243, type: 3}
    appearance: '[Unnamable grotesque artwork.]'
    solutionLines:
    - Lower the Oxygen. Its brush slows... and stops.
    - Feed it, before it finishes painting your face.
    lockedLines:
    - "\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0. Its brush \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0."
    - "\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0, before it finishes \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0."
  - icon: {fileID: -2401169965858233650, guid: c895adf0b24bf1f48bc57f3d0c3d4523, type: 3}
    appearance: '[Colorful venom.]'
    solutionLines:
    - Make a Sound. Watch them flinch.
    - Lower the Oxygen. The poison spreads slower... for now.
    lockedLines:
    - "\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0. Watch them flinch."
    - "\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0. The poison \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0 for now."
